        {
          "id": "5fd43b83fe3bbfe18ef4df23",
          "questionNumber": 1,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>In the following number series, a wrong number is given. Find out the wrong number.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;2, 26, 286, 2004, 10010, 30030</p>",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "26",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "2004",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "286",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "2",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "30030",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "2",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p>2 &times; 13 = 26,&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>26&nbsp;&times;&nbsp; 11 = 286,</p>\n\n<p>286&nbsp;&times;&nbsp; 7 = 2002,&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>2002&nbsp;&times;&nbsp; 5 = 10010,</p>\n\n<p>10010&nbsp;&times;&nbsp; 3 = 30030.</p>\n\n<p>The wrong term is&nbsp;2004.</p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
        {
          "id": "5bfd2fd4dff41c0caed96117",
          "questionNumber": 2,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>Find the wrong number&nbsp;in the series.</p>\n\n<p>14, 23, 35, 63, 119, 231</p>",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "119",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
