              "text": "63",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "231",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "23",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "14",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "4",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p>Logic used: next number in the series can be obtained by adding number which double itself starting from 7.</p>\n\n<p>The pattern of the given series:</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 14 + 7 = 21</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 21 + 14 = 35</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 35 + 28 = 63</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 63 + 56 = 119</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 119 + 112 = 231</p>\n&there4; The wrong number in the series = 23",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
        {
          "id": "5eecb04e25226a3b564e106e",
          "questionNumber": 3,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>In each of the following number series, the wrong number is given, find out that number.</p>\n\n<p>9, 17, 24, 31, 35, 39</p>",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "9",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "17",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "24",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "31",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "35",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "4",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p>The series follows the following pattern:</p>\n\n<p>9 + 8 = 17</p>\n\n<p>17 + 7 = 24</p>\n\n<p>24 + 6 = 30</p>\n\n<p>30 + 5 = 35</p>\n\n<p>35 + 4 = 39</p>\n\n<p>&there4; The wrong term in the series is 31.</p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
        {
          "id": "5af52a269df38839c295f83f",
          "questionNumber": 4,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>Find out the wrong number in the series.</p>\n\n<p>17, 23, 35, 55, 85, 125</p>",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "17",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "23",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "55",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "85",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "125",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "5",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p>&rArr; 17 + 2 &times; 3 = 23</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 23 + 3 &times; 4 = 35</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 35 + 4 &times; 5 = 55</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 55 + 5 &times; 6 = 85</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 85 + 6 &times; 7 = <strong>127</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; Wrong number in series is&nbsp;125</strong></p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
        {
          "id": "608901f9116c3fca3079091c",
          "questionNumber": 5,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>In the following number series, a wrong number is given. Find out the wrong number.</p>\n\n<p>4500, 900, 225, 75, 37</p>",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "900",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "37",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "75",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "4500",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "225",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "2",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p>4500, 900, 225, 75, 37</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The logic follows here is:</p>\n\n<p>4500&nbsp;&divide; 5 = 900</p>\n\n<p>900&nbsp;&divide; 4 = 225</p>\n\n<p>225&nbsp;&divide; 3 = 75</p>\n\n<p>75&nbsp;&divide; 2 = 37.5&nbsp;<strong>&ne; 37</strong></p>\n\n<p>There should be 37.5 instead of 37</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The wrong term is 37.</strong></p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
