          "explanation": "<p>The series follows the following pattern:</p>\n\n<p>12 + 2.5 = 14.5</p>\n\n<p>14.5 + 4.5 = 19</p>\n\n<p>19&nbsp;+ 6.5 = 25.5&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>25.5 + 8.5 = 34</p>\n\n<p>34&nbsp;+ 10.5 = 44.5</p>\n\n<p>&there4; The wrong term in the series is 43.5.</p>",
